# Infect damage to a creature is dealt as that many -1/-1 counters, not marked damage (CR 702.90c, 120.3d). On turn 3
# Bot1's animated Inkmoth Nexus (1/1 flying, infect) attacks and Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla (2/2 reach) blocks it: the
# Gorilla gets one -1/-1 counter and is a 1/1 with no damage marked, and its own 2 ordinary damage kills the Nexus,
# which goes to the graveyard as the land card it is. Nothing reached Bot2: no poison, no life lost.

